2. Potential Revenue lost from Personalized Semaglutide Solutions are overstated 

• $HIMS's management is guiding $2.3-2.4bn of Revenue in FY 2025;

• FY 2025 Total Revenue includes ~$725m for Weight Loss Solutions, which comprises:👇

- Semaglutide Solutions for Q1 until the stocks are sold out (estimates: $200m);✅           
- Oral Solutions (estimates: $215m);✅
- Liraglutide Solutions (estimates: $55m);✅
- Personalized Semaglutide Solutions               (estimates: $255m);❌

• Due to regulatory risks associated with Personalized Semaglutide it would be fair to say that $255m of Revenue are at risk to be lost in FY 2025.

• Therefore, If we assume no Revenue from Personalized Semaglutide Solutions, $HIMS would still generate $2,095m of Revenue in 2025.

• $HIMS valuation is really attractive even without considering any revenue from Personalized Semaglutide Solutions. See below👇

- Market Value (as of today) = $6,474m ;
- Net Cash Position ((Q4 2024)) = $289m;
- Enterprise Value (EV) = $6,474m - $289m = $6,185m;

- FY25E $HIMS EV/Revenue = 2.95x (excl. GLP-1s);

• These risks are highly overstated by Mr. Market as the current valuation is significantly low even without considering any revenue from Personalized Semaglutide Solutions in FY25E. 

• $HIMS has been IPOed at 8.9x EV/Revenue in January 2021.🤯

@meladeenc @DrNadolsky Semaglutide vs. Tirzepatide ✨

🔹 Semaglutide curbs cravings &amp; keeps you full longer.
🔹 Tirzepatide boosts fat burning &amp; appetite control.

• $HIMS's management is guiding $2.300-2.400m of Revenue in FY 2025;

• FY 2025 Total Revenue includes ~$725m for Weight Loss Solutions, which comprises: 

 - Commercial Semaglutide Solutions only for Q1               until the stocks are sold out (estimates: $200m);
- Oral Solutions (estimates: $215m);            
- Personalized Semaglutide Solutions (estimates: $255m); 

• Due to regulatory risks associated with Personalized Semaglutide it would be fair to say that $255m of potential Revenue are at risk to be lost in FY 2025.

• Therefore, If we assume no Revenue from Personalized Semaglutide Solutions, $HIMS would still generate $2,095m of Revenue in 2025, which implies ~50% revenue growth for the Core Business.

